{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Cyclone",
    "schema_version": "0.1",
    "category": "Specialty Equipment",
    "description": "Cyclone dust separator (reference model hand-built from Cyclone.pdf for testing FamFab): cone as a coaxial blend (built in Revit as a revolution), cylindrical body, outlet pipe with flange, volute tangential inlet (inlet flange outer edge 800 mm from the axis as dimensioned; inner wall runs from the flange tangent to the body, outer wall turns 45° tangentially into the body; tangent point computed for default sizes), inlet flange, discharge flange with bore, 4 support lugs (base plate + 2 triangular gussets, 200 mm) at the bottom of the cylindrical shell. Assumed: flange thicknesses, inlet length 450 along -Y.",
    "prompt": "Front view + view A (bottom). Ø900 x 850 cylinder, cone 1620 to Ø200, discharge flange Ø300/Ø210, outlet Ø470 h90 with flange Ø580, inlet 250x420 with flange 355x520, 800 from axis to inlet flange edge."
  },
  "units": "millimeters",
  "subcategories": [
